@startuml F3.3-D01-fila-deliberacao
title F3.3-D01 — Fila de deliberação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /solicitacoes?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests?canDeliberate=true
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT fila\n(canDeliberate)
note right of Ctrl
  workflow + requiresAuthority
  x authorities do professor
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 lista
note right of WebApp
  prazo_em < now
  → badge danger (client)
end note
WebApp --> Prof: fila por prazo ASC

@enduml
